most likely diagnosis?\n\nA bladder neoplasm.\n\nPregnancy.\n\n. Acute retention of urine.\n\nChronic retention of urine.\n\nA neuropathic bladder with an incompetent urethral sphincter.\n\nTMOORP>\n\nMCQ 3.158\n\nA 32-year-old man with a testicular neoplasm has para-aortic lymph node\ninvolvement more than 15cm diameter on clinical examination, confirmed by\nabdominal computed tomograph (CT) estimation. Which one of the following\ntreatment options is the most appropriate?\n\nRadiation therapy to the para-aortic nodes.\n\nChemoradiotherapy alone.\n\n. Surgical excision of nodes plus chemotherapy, with delayed orchidectomy.\n\n. Orchidectomy plus chemoradiotherapy and delayed surgery for residual nodes.\nRadiation therapy to the primary tumour and the para-aortic lymph nodes.\n\nMOQR?>\n\n273"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","therapy"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"01523c1c1a4887e714a5496dc9ab7b51e1994fbb","duplicate_group_id":"exact-01523c1c1a48","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"fcab781645bb118556c9","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":291,"source_qid":"3.156"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visua