+. Urine\nmicroscopy shows no cells or bacilli and culture is arranged.\n\nHis serum biochemistry is as shown:\n\nUrea *11.2mmol/L — (3.0-8.0)\nCreatinine *O.11mmol/L (0.06-0.12)\nBilirubin (Total) *13mmol/L (<20)\n\nGamma glutamy! trans- —15mmol/L (<50)\nferase (GGT)\n\nAlkaline phosphatase 92mmol/L (25-100)\n(ALP)\n\nAlanine aminotrans- *4A56mmol/L — (<35)\nferase (ALT)\n\nAspartate aminotrans- *1085mmol/L (<40)\nferase (AST)\n\nLactate dehydrogenase *1311mmol/L (110-230)\n\n(LD)\nCreatine kinase (CK) *32767U/L (60-220)\nC-Reactive Protein *17.6mg/L (<3.0)\n\nWhich one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","record_type":"text_mcq","options_mode":"text","parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"931ea15f35e77c13361781712848fb0cea72eebe","duplicate_group_id":"exact-931ea15f35e7","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"cb8ed3ef2a4014a979fd","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":292,"source_qid":"3.159"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current