ation yielded 30mL of dark urine positive for blood.\nj X-ray of chest, limbs and abdomen showed no bony injuries. His electrocardiogram\n(ECG) showed the pattern illustrated over a 15-minute period (ECG A and ECG B).\n| The ECG changes demonstrate evidence of which one of the following electrolyte\n» | abnormalities?\n| Bet 4 X Neh K \\ K fo tectscccans per\nB) i ‘ a Varaty br VIN I $B 190 428/€89 11 5-80\n| a ARAL prerrisesnhels \\\nmy mp\n: memes ceri reat a NNN VEZ}\nGi\nBle ; j clingy eta Iaacd bh\nmee ‘| : |\nSII ert eee\nECGA ECG B\n! 279"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age"],"likely_visual_question":true,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","record_type":"text_mcq","options_mode":"text","parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"9a4acd8938bb78d14ddc020776c87cf67fed2cde","duplicate_group_id":"exact-9a4acd8938bb","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"e142c682438339c14818","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":297,"source_qid":"3.164"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=exclud