and continue thereafter.","E":"No intercourse in the follicular phase of the cycle, commence intercourse two\ndays after temperature elevation of 0.3°C and continue thereafter.\n\nMCQ 3.219\n\nA 60-year-old woman, who had three pregnancies before the age of 30 years,\ncomplains of incontinence of urine for the last 12 months. Because of this problem,\nshe has had to wear a ‘pad inside her panties all the time. She is not taking any\nhormone replacement therapy. Which one of the following symptoms would indicate\nthat the incontinence is probably genuine stress incontinence?\n\n307"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","contracept","pregnan","therapy","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"3a8e182938e2df63bcc3c50961b12641705f58d8","duplicate_group_id":"exact-3a8e182938e2","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"cec4c21d7e5a9ec35f92","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":325,"source_qid":"3.217"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_