MCQ 3.232
An 11-month-old infant presents with a temperature of 39.5°C and persistent crying. —
He had a mild fever with a runny nose five days previously. He attends day care two
days a week. Otoscopic examination shows a dull inflamed left tympanic membrane
which is bulging outwards. He has not been treated for any ear problems previously. |
Which one of the following is the most appropriate treatment for this child? | 4','{"A":"Aspirin and cotrimoxazole orally.","B":"Ibuprofen and erythromycin orally.","C":"Naproxen orally and ciprofloxacin topically.","D":"Lignocaine topically and myringotomy. |","E":"Paracetamol and amoxycillin orally. :\n\nMCQ 3.233\n\nA male infant has the following head circumference measurements recorded in his\ninfant welfare book.\n\nAge Head circumference\n\nBirth 35cm\n\n6 weeks 39cm\n\n3 months 43cm ches chart\n6 months 45cm\n\nHis parents are concerned that his head looks too big. His general development has\nbeen normal. Which one of the following is the best course of action?\n\nera anemia sane\nHE BHR Ee HH REBER\n; : eeu\nHEHE BESS HRES guuDee eattiiiniul Hi :\naH eH iy uu Besa BuRbED ad epee tat\nee ee\nSE Se SURE A RE Seppe ce aa\nBa) ail ut sc aauMNEREEnA\nHS 7a Bi is ET ES cae\nBAR cee\nGj SSRRRR SHES ERNE HRN RRES\nTERN TREN BREE EN BREE ENARREBRBEEeeBeee\nPeers errr ¥\ngt MME Nia E Teun EGUaE He\n\nHead circumference percentile growth chart (boys)\nin utero 28-40 weeks, 0-12 months of age"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.232","duplicate_group_id":"exact-dc2b4c492a4c","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"106f344662946bd3aac2","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":332,"source_qid":"3.232"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"106f344662946bd3aac2","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Mu