| MCQ 3.250
3 Pubertal events normally take place in a sequential manner. Knowledge of this
f will assist the clinician in defining the likely cause of any pubertal development
) abnormality which occurs and in answering parental concerns. Which one of the
following progression of events in girls is correct?','{"A":"Breast budding; pubic and axillary hair; acceleration of growth.","B":"Acceleration of growth; breast budding; pubic and axillary hair.","C":"Breast budding; acceleration of growth; pubic and axillary hair.","D":"Pubic and axillary hair; acceleration of growth; breast budding.","E":"Acceleration of growth; pubic and axillary hair; breast budding.\nMCQ 3.251\n| A 2-year-old boy who attends day care four days a week is brought to see you as his\nmother is worried about his poor appetite, frequent upper respiratory infections and\n, poor energy levels.\nPhysical examination reveals no abnormality. He is on the 25th percentile for height,\n; weight, and head circumference.\nInvestigations show:\n| Haemoglobin (Hb) 143g/L (130-180)\nt White cell count (WCC) 5.5x10°/L (4-11)\nSerum sodium 143mmol/L (135-145)\nSerum potassium 4.Ammol/L (3.5-4.9)\nSerum chloride 107mmol/L (95-110)\nBlood glucose 5.8mmol/L (3-7.7)\nLiver function tests normal\n. Serum iron *5umol/L (10-33)\nSerum ferritin Alumol/L (6-60)\nt Which one of the following would be the most appropriate management?\n; A. Remove from day care.\nB. Reassure.\nC. Refer to an immunologist.\nD. Commence iron supplements.\nE. Coeliac disease serology.\nMCQ 3.252\nAn 8-week-old baby girl is brought to a general practice for advice regarding timing of\ncommencement of routine vaccinations. She was born prematurely at thirty-two weeks\ngestation, birth weight 1665gm. She had respiratory distress requiring supplemental\noxygen for one week. She is now healthy with a weight of 3kg. Which one of the\nfollowing is the appropriate advice on the timing of commencing vaccinations?\n_F 321"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.250","duplicate_group_id":"exact-a12196615696","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"4a4b743ffb9f3ad0a10a","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96