MCQ 3.271
A 6-year-old child presents with a 24-hour history of fever and drowsiness. On
examination a prominent petechial rash on his limbs and trunk is noted. After arranging
blood cultures, which one of the following is the most appropriate initial antibiotic
therapy?','{"A":"Phenoxymethylpenicillin.","B":"Vancomycin.","C":"Amoxycillin.","D":"Ceftriaxone.","E":"Erythromycin.\n\nMCQ 3.272\n\nA 12-year-old girl presents with a two-day history of low grade fever, frequency and\ndysuria. Her midstream urine shows significant pyuria, bacilluria and is nitrites positive.\nWhich one of the following is the most appropriate initial therapy?\n\nA. Trimethoprim.\nB. Norfloxacin.\nC. Amoxycillin.\nD. Vancomycin.\nE. Gentamicin.\n\nMCQ 3.273\n\nAn 11-year-old boy presents with a 24-hour history of fever and a sore throat. On\nexamination he is febrile (38.4°C) and has red inflamed tonsils with exudate and\ntender cervical lymph nodes. You suspect on assessment a bacterial cause. He has\nno known allergies. Which one of the following antibiotics is the most appropriate\ninitial therapy?\n\nA. Amoxycillin.\n\nB. Phenoxymethylpenicillin.\nC. Cotrimoxazole.\n\nD. Cefaclor.\n\nE. Tetracycline."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.271","duplicate_group_id":"exact-ee7fe545ed6e","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"690ceef01c331dc4b23e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":346,"source_qid":"3.271"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"690ceef01c331dc4b23e","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":346,"source_qid":"3.271","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"Australian Medical Counc